  "bodyHash": "0CRnjmbQG8E=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">原始專案很快就會更新，請密切關注<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方頁面</a>！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish 的槍械模組</a> 的非官方移植版，<strong>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framework</a></strong>。</span></p><p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">MrCrayfish 的槍械模組是一款新穎且令人興奮的武器模組，具有獨特的視野。它新增了九種武器，每種武器都可以高度自訂，創造屬於你自己的獨特變體。使用配件和附魔，你可以提升武器的屬性，打造更強大的版本。染料可以用來改變任何武器和配件的顏色。此模組還新增了手榴彈和閃光彈！</span></em></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">移植版本所做的更改：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">1. 閃光彈的音效現在是單聲道（參考 <a href=\"https://github.com/MrCrayfish/MrCrayfishGunMod/pull/506\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfishGunMod#506</a>，新檔案由 ffmpeg 生成）；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">2. 現在你可以將染過色的 CGM 物品浸入裝滿水的大鍋中來洗掉染色；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">3. 彈殼的模型已修正；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">4. 重新裝彈動畫中彈藥物品的渲染方向已修正；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">5. 為以下項目實作了額外的相容性：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">旅行者背包</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-planes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Planes</a>；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">...</span></li></ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果 MrCrayfish 也更新到此版本，你應優先<strong>使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始模組</a></strong>！</span></p>",
